OL,4,CChild lying not bad                  W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GWhen drawings appear on the wall or  W5
OL,7,Gbiscuits disappear from the tin,     W5
OL,8,Gyour child might blame the dog or    W5
OL,9,Gclaim there was a ghost - even if    W5
OL,10,Gthey are clutching crayons or        W5
OL,11,Gcovered in crumbs.                   W5
OL,12,                                      W5
OL,13,GChildren telling fibs is something   W5
OL,14,Gmost parents experience, but such    W5
OL,15,Gdishonesty and deception is an       W5
OL,16,Gimportant part of mental development.W5
